&gt;&gt; Well, you already forgot
one thing.
>> 好吧，你已经忘记了
一件事。

16:42.501 --> 16:44.378
&gt;&gt;
No, I haven't.
>>
不，我没有。

16:44.461 --> 16:45.921
Have I?
我有吗？

16:46.004 --> 16:48.132
&gt;&gt; Hello?
My birthday cake!
>> 你好？
我的生日蛋糕！

16:48.215 --> 16:49.800
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah, that!
>> 哦，是的，那个！

16:49.883 --> 16:51.593
I was, um, just getting to that.
我，嗯，刚刚开始。

16:51.677 --> 16:54.179
That's why I was here
in town, yeah.
这就是我来这里的原因
在城里，是的。

16:56.306 --> 16:57.975
You are hilarious, Star.
You really are.
你真搞笑，星星。
你确实是。

16:58.058 --> 17:00.185
Now you just go home,
现在你只要回家，

17:00.269 --> 17:01.603
and I'm gonna go get your cake,
you silly guy, you.
我要去拿你的蛋糕
你这个傻家伙，你。

17:03.939 --> 17:05.941
Hi, I need a birthday cake.
你好，我需要一个生日蛋糕。

17:06.024 --> 17:07.693
&gt;&gt; This is what I got.
>> 这就是我得到的。

17:07.776 --> 17:10.320
&gt;&gt; "Sorry about the scabies."
>>“关于疥疮，我深表歉意。”

17:10.404 --> 17:12.948
Um, can you change it to say
happy birthday?
嗯，你能把它改成这样吗
生日快乐吗？

17:13.031 --> 17:15.159
&gt;&gt;
Do you want it or not?
>>
你想要还是不想要？

17:15.242 --> 17:16.952
I haven't got all night.
我一整夜都没有。

17:17.035 --> 17:18.871
&gt;&gt; Yeah, neither do I.
>> 是的，我也没有。

17:23.917 --> 17:26.128
Sandy's drill!
桑迪的演习！

17:36.430 --> 17:38.140
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob!
&gt;&gt; Oh! Hi!
>> 海绵宝宝！
>>哦！你好！

17:38.223 --> 17:40.184
I was just--
我只是——

17:40.267 --> 17:41.852
Making sure you have
all your hardware.
确保你有
你所有的硬件。

17:41.935 --> 17:43.270
&gt;&gt; That's an unusual getup.
>> 这是一种不寻常的装束。

17:43.353 --> 17:45.397
&gt;&gt; Oh, I thought I'd be...
>> 哦，我以为我会...

17:45.481 --> 17:46.982
A little festive, you know,
for the scientists.
有点节日气氛，你知道，
对于科学家来说。

17:47.066 --> 17:48.442
&gt;&gt; And the birthday cake?
>> 生日蛋糕呢？

17:49.443 --> 17:51.945
&gt;&gt; Uh--
>> 呃--

17:54.114 --> 17:56.241
&gt;&gt; Greetings,
my distinguished colleagues.
>> 您好，
尊敬的同事们。

17:56.325 --> 17:59.077
Tonight you will witness
an invention so revolutionary
今晚你将见证
如此革命性的发明

17:59.161 --> 18:01.622
it may change modern science
forever.
它可能会改变现代科学
永远。

18:01.705 --> 18:03.665
Now to demonstrate,
现在来演示一下，

18:03.749 --> 18:06.335
my assistant here will disrobe
and enter the machine.
我这里的助理会脱衣服
并进入机器。

18:06.418 --> 18:07.836
&gt;&gt; What?
>> 什么？

18:07.920 --> 18:09.588
&gt;&gt; Some of you may be wondering
>> 你们中有些人可能想知道

18:09.671 --> 18:11.381
why the test subject
is disrobing.
为什么测试对象
正在脱衣服。

18:11.465 --> 18:12.966
It's because--
这是因为——

18:13.050 --> 18:14.301
what's under your gown?
你的礼服下面是什么？

18:15.636 --> 18:18.138
&gt;&gt; Oh, must be that spicy kelp
I ate earlier.
>>哦，一定是那个辣海带
我之前吃过。

18:18.222 --> 18:20.849
I've got to use the laboratory.
我必须使用实验室。

18:20.933 --> 18:22.226
I'll be right Pat--Back.
我马上就回来。

18:22.309 --> 18:23.727
Back--I'll be right--
回来--我会的--

18:29.858 --> 18:32.986
&gt;&gt; You finally made it!
>> 你终于成功了！

18:33.070 --> 18:35.697
&gt;&gt; Yeah, big traffic storm.
>> 是的，大交通风暴。

18:35.781 --> 18:40.202
&gt;&gt; Well, just leave my present
over on the present table.
>> 好吧，留下我的礼物吧
在目前的桌子上。

18:42.830 --> 18:44.706
&gt;&gt; Your present?
>> 你的礼物？

18:44.790 --> 18:46.959
&gt;&gt; I'm so excited I've been
waiting for a whole year!
>> 我太兴奋了
等了整整一年！

18:47.042 --> 18:48.627
&gt;&gt; Oh, I've got it!
It's right there.
>>哦，我明白了！
它就在那里。

18:53.006 --> 18:54.383
Ta dah!
哒哒！

18:54.466 --> 18:56.468
All wrapped and ready to go.
一切都包装好，准备出发。

18:56.552 --> 18:58.512
&gt;&gt; Well, what are you
waiting for, buddy?
>> 那么，你是什么？
还在等吗，伙计？

18:58.595 --> 19:01.723
Serve up the cake
so I can tear into that present.
把蛋糕端上来
这样我就可以撕碎这份礼物了。

19:01.807 --> 19:04.977
&gt;&gt; The cake!
I must've left it at Sandy's.
>> 蛋糕！
我一定是把它忘在桑迪家了。

19:05.060 --> 19:06.728
&gt;&gt; You took it to Sandy's?
&gt;&gt; No!
>> 你把它带到桑迪家了？
>> 不！

19:06.812 --> 19:08.272
I said, uh,
"the bakery delivers,
我说，呃，
“面包店提供，

19:08.355 --> 19:10.190
isn't that handy?"
这不是很方便吗？”

19:10.274 --> 19:12.067
In fact, I think
I hear them outside.
其实我觉得
我听到他们在外面。

19:12.150 --> 19:13.402
Wait right there
while I go check.
就在那里等一下
当我去检查时。

19:18.740 --> 19:20.075
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob.
>> 海绵宝宝。

19:20.158 --> 19:22.035
&gt;&gt; Barnacles.
>> 藤壶。

19:22.119 --> 19:24.204
&gt;&gt; I apologize for the delay.
>> 对于延迟，我深表歉意。

19:24.288 --> 19:25.831
Now let's continue
the demonstration.
现在我们继续
示威。

19:25.914 --> 19:28.208
I give you...
我给你...

19:34.464 --> 19:36.550
This device gives
a single laborer
该设备提供
一个工人

19:36.633 --> 19:38.760
the productivity of five,
six, seven,
五人的生产力，
六、七、

19:38.844 --> 19:41.346
up to eight workers,
which is great for management.
最多八名工人，
这对于管理来说非常有用。

19:41.430 --> 19:43.390
But it's also a boon
for the worker
但这也是一种福利
对于工人

19:43.473 --> 19:45.100
because they'll always get
high marks
因为他们总会得到
高分

19:45.183 --> 19:47.311
on their employee report cards
在他们的员工报告卡上

19:47.394 --> 19:49.688
&gt;&gt; I was just looking
at your employee report card.
>> 我只是想看看
在您的员工报告卡上。

19:49.771 --> 19:51.690
&gt;&gt; Ah, the telescope!
>> 啊，望远镜！

19:51.773 --> 19:56.320
&gt;&gt; Without further delay,
I shall initiate Proto-Sequence.
>> 事不宜迟，
我将启动原始序列。

19:56.403 --> 19:57.988
&gt;&gt; Uh, Sandy, I hate to delay
the proceedings,
>> 呃，桑迪，我讨厌拖延
诉讼程序，

19:58.071 --> 19:59.781
but, um, I forgot to mail in
但是，嗯，我忘了邮寄

19:59.865 --> 20:01.116
this mail-in rebate, and...
这个邮寄回扣，以及...

20:01.199 --> 20:02.409
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

20:07.581 --> 20:09.625
Okay, let's get started,
Mr. Krabs.
好吧，让我们开始吧，
蟹老板。

20:09.708 --> 20:11.543
&gt;&gt; What happened
to your clothes, boy?
>> 发生了什么
你的衣服，男孩？

20:11.627 --> 20:13.462
&gt;&gt; Uh, sardines.
>> 呃，沙丁鱼。

20:13.545 --> 20:15.130
Yeah, I was attacked
by a can of wild sardines.
是的，我被攻击了
一罐野生沙丁鱼。

20:15.213 --> 20:16.590
Now let's finish this telescope.
现在让我们完成这个望远镜。

20:19.134 --> 20:20.302
&gt;&gt; Boy?
>> 男孩？

20:21.803 --> 20:23.722
Hold on, boy.
坚持住，男孩。

20:23.805 --> 20:25.140
You're supposed to be using
that motorized hex drill.
你应该使用
那个电动六角钻。

20:25.223 --> 20:27.100
Where is it?
它在哪里？

20:27.184 --> 20:28.810
&gt;&gt;
I left it at Patrick's rock.
>>
我把它留在了帕特里克的岩石上。

20:28.894 --> 20:30.228
&gt;&gt; Patrick's rock?
>> 帕特里克的摇滚？

20:30.312 --> 20:31.688
What's it doin' there?
它在那里做什么？

20:31.772 --> 20:33.690
SpongeBob, wait!
海绵宝宝，等等！

20:33.774 --> 20:35.108
Get back here, boy!
回到这里吧，孩子！

20:35.192 --> 20:36.818
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

20:38.904 --> 20:42.199
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob,
why are your clothes invisible?
>> 海绵宝宝,
为什么你的衣服是看不见的？

20:42.282 --> 20:44.159
&gt;&gt; Never mind that.
>> 没关系。

20:44.242 --> 20:46.370
Can I please borrow
your present?
我可以借一下吗
你的礼物？

20:46.453 --> 20:47.913
&gt;&gt; No, no! No, you can't borrow
my birthday present.
>> 不，不！不，你不能借
我的生日礼物。

20:47.996 --> 20:49.831
&gt;&gt; Not even for a minute?
>> 一分钟都没有吗？

20:49.915 --> 20:51.750
&gt;&gt; No, not until they deliver
my birthday cake.
>> 不，直到他们交付为止
我的生日蛋糕。

20:51.833 --> 20:53.585
&gt;&gt;
Okay, I'll be right back.
>>
好的，我马上回来。

20:53.669 --> 20:55.837
&gt;&gt; Hold on!
Where you going?
>> 坚持住！
你要去哪里？

21:01.843 --> 21:02.844
&gt;&gt; I'm here.
>> 我在这儿。

21:05.722 --> 21:07.474
&gt;&gt; Hold it!
>> 坚持住！

21:07.557 --> 21:09.059
Where's my little assistant
going this time?
我的小助理在哪里
这次去吗？

21:09.142 --> 21:10.894
&gt;&gt; Your little assistant?
>> 你的小助手？

21:10.978 --> 21:12.604
That's my assistant
you're talking to.
这是我的助理
你正在说话。

21:12.688 --> 21:14.272
What's going on around here?
这附近发生了什么事？

21:14.356 --> 21:17.067
&gt;&gt; Yeah, I'd like to know also.
>> 嗯，我也想知道。

21:17.150 --> 21:19.903
What kinda birthday present
is this?
什么样的生日礼物
这是吗？

21:19.987 --> 21:22.906
&gt;&gt; Hey, SpongeBob was supposed
to bring that to me!
>> 嘿，海绵宝宝应该是
把它带给我！

21:22.990 --> 21:25.033
&gt;&gt; That looks like
my  power drill.
>> 看起来像
我的电钻。

21:25.117 --> 21:27.369
You've got a lot of explainin'
to do, mister.
你有很多解释
要做，先生。

21:30.414 --> 21:31.999
I've got something to say.
I've got something--
我有话要说。
我有东西——

21:32.082 --> 21:34.042
I have got something to say!
我有话要说！

21:35.419 --> 21:37.462
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

21:37.546 --> 21:40.048
I know you all had important
things going on tonight:
我知道你们都有重要的经历
今晚发生的事情：

21:40.132 --> 21:41.967
Mr. Krabs with your telescope;
蟹老板带着你的望远镜；

21:42.050 --> 21:43.844
Patrick, your birthday;
帕特里克，你的生日；

21:43.927 --> 21:46.179
and Sandy, you had
this big presentation.
还有桑迪，你有
这场盛大的演讲。

21:46.263 --> 21:48.098
I just couldn't say no
to any of you.
我只是无法拒绝
给你们任何一个人。

21:48.181 --> 21:50.308
&gt;&gt; Aw, you overextended
yourself.
>> 噢，你太过分了
你自己。

21:50.392 --> 21:52.310
&gt;&gt; Yeah, you should have said
something.
>> 是的，你应该说
某事。

21:52.394 --> 21:54.229
&gt;&gt; We could've
worked something out.
>> 我们本来可以
解决了一些问题。

21:54.312 --> 21:56.481
&gt;&gt; Aw, you know,
you guys are right.
>> 哦，你知道，
你们是对的。

21:56.565 --> 21:59.317
It was silly to think I could be
in three places at once.
认为我可以是很愚蠢的
同时在三个地方。

21:59.401 --> 22:02.029
&gt;&gt; Nonsense, SpongeBob.
Of course you can,
>> 废话，海绵宝宝。
当然可以，

22:02.112 --> 22:06.366
if you'll just step
into the Proto-Generator 2000.
如果你愿意迈出一步
进入 Proto-Generator 2000。

22:06.450 --> 22:08.410
First, I close
the Proto-Chamber.
首先，我关闭
原型室。

22:10.746 --> 22:11.997
And finally...
最后...

22:21.006 --> 22:22.591
&gt;&gt; Oh!
>>哦！

22:22.674 --> 22:23.925
&gt;&gt; Oh!
>>哦！

22:24.009 --> 22:25.677
&gt;&gt; As you can see,
>> 如您所见，

22:25.761 --> 22:27.846
I've produced two clones
of my subject
我已经产生了两个克隆体
我的主题

22:27.929 --> 22:29.431
which will allow him to honor
all the commitments
这将使他能够尊重
所有的承诺

22:29.514 --> 22:31.016
he's made this evening.
他今天晚上就成功了。

22:32.601 --> 22:34.519
Did you hear that, SpongeBob?
你听到了吗，海绵宝宝？

22:34.603 --> 22:35.979
You can be in three places
at once now.
你可以在三个地方
现在立刻。

